{"3292770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FIEFDOM", "steam_appid": 3292770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clash swords</strong>, <strong>cast spells</strong>, <strong>rain down arrows &amp; more in FIEFDOM</strong>: <strong>a medieval melee slasher set in a dynamic world</strong>. Raise your realm to glory in battles of up to 100 players both by land &amp; by sea. Dive into a world where your victories define the victor of entire wars. Who will you be fighting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIEFDOM is currently in Pre-Alpha, accessible only to our Kickstarter backers. </strong>Everything you see is subject to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/420006207d218622a766a4df1592bea5.avif?t=1777916959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras_big/420006207d218622a766a4df1592bea5.avif?t=1777916959 width=800 height=144 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/c686b8f9ee392a56acc101816aa6d049.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/f26d1775ffe0ed3fe3081d21398db78b.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/f26d1775ffe0ed3fe3081d21398db78b.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/f26d1775ffe0ed3fe3081d21398db78b.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIEFDOM’s combat has been designed to bring magic and melee together like never before</strong>, allowing for novel, unique playstyles to emerge and for you to delve into. Wield anywhere from brutal polearms and maces, to halfswording a svelte but lethal greatsword and anywhere in-between. Enjoy hundreds of hours crafting and perfecting your own deadly martial arts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/0b7279f3ec6d0e5ce1e667e787ac9dd6.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/70453d63d44ada58767013100a65e549.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/70453d63d44ada58767013100a65e549.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/70453d63d44ada58767013100a65e549.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take your battles to the sea and to the shores</strong>, where siege engines, galleons and more take to the fray. Pilot &amp; steer large ships with your crew or AI allies and take full control of the battlefield! Simple contraptions like barricades and ladders, to onagres and cannons are available for you to shape the battlefield with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/605b848e3b7bd67fc5158172373ae9cc.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/09e1be0df0da661b9062d525343df64d.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/09e1be0df0da661b9062d525343df64d.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/09e1be0df0da661b9062d525343df64d.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The collective victories and defeats of the playerbase define how the world of FIEFDOM evolves via its content updates</strong>. The past is already defined, the present is for you to play and the future is for us to reflect in FIEFDOM's major updates. <strong>Which factions thrive or wither are for you to define!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/9052d3265fe96b444639d9721e8614f0.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=117 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/03f00346d2d7c1eda93b92f994718595.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/03f00346d2d7c1eda93b92f994718595.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/03f00346d2d7c1eda93b92f994718595.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize and expand your characters to play exactly as you want them to</strong>. Spend your talent points; pick, match and modify pieces of armour and weapons and create your own coat of arms. Between our more than 100 armor pieces, more than 30 weapons, dozens of sigils and colour swatches, combat stances &amp; more, <strong>no player will look and play alike</strong> - make yourself recognizable across the entire game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/1a2f5402ae129c0c443029984f266ddd.avif?t=1777916959\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras_big/1a2f5402ae129c0c443029984f266ddd.webp?t=1777916959 width=1560 height=277 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you pledge your allegiance to the <strong>noble Renhirites</strong>, the <strong>ambitious Sulmites</strong> or the <strong>stark Mazovians? </strong>Fight in battles of up to 100 players and drive your realm to glory with each victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/4d0517fdd19322b42ad69d7962c0d2d1.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/4d0517fdd19322b42ad69d7962c0d2d1.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/4d0517fdd19322b42ad69d7962c0d2d1.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/3a36484020333cc22e844e960b57b99e.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=1215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/cd46492b2b61fa4b37535deef5ae4b52.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/cd46492b2b61fa4b37535deef5ae4b52.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/cd46492b2b61fa4b37535deef5ae4b52.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/6c4f9e18d97468894eed610f2ac4e33e.poster.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/6c4f9e18d97468894eed610f2ac4e33e.webm?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/6c4f9e18d97468894eed610f2ac4e33e.mp4?t=1777916959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292770/extras/9cc2b30610579112adee89c00f27732b.avif?t=1777916959\" width=1170 height=1215 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_para